INDEX notes/plan/
The live plan: one directory per bucket; plan.json lists them. Run `node plan-graph.js --ready` for what can be worked now, `--check` to audit.

F README.md         Plan front door: data model, tooling, soft spots
F plan.json         Root manifest: the bucket list
F plan.md           Root prose: the plan's top-matter (lifecycle, numbering, dates)
F edges.json        Root edge index: every needs/super edge, kept in the same commit as its bucket.json
F plan-graph.js     Reader/checker: ready, blocked, edges, suspect, prose, outline, --liza, --check
F plan-graph.js.cld Symbol index for plan-graph.js
F spent-ids.txt     Every number this plan has spent (none yet)
F index.cld         This index
D bugs/             Named bucket: plan-system defects as slug-id nodes (shape slugged); empty
